    <briefdescription>
<para>Provides CoreSight Debug Communication Channel (DCC) byte I/O. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>CoreSight driver component.</para><para>Coresight is part of the Debug Communication Channel (DCC) group. JTAG UART for ARM uses DCC. Each ARM core has its own DCC. Select an ARM target in the XSDB console before running the jtag terminal command. The CoreSight driver can direct the output stream to a log file.</para><para><preformatted>
